 I ran the same rollback to v2.3.0 again and it completed. All three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create it timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't send a second one that could page on-call twice. The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the orchestrator error and the retry) and the next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error, and don't redeploy v2.3.1 until it's fixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}